      "source_text": "你是何人？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Who are you?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00207",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "从开天辟地之后，这峨眉山就是我独居之处。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Ever since the world was created, this Mount Emei has been my own solitary dwelling.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00207",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你一个人竟然闯进峨眉山，一定不是什么等闲之人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For you to barge into Mount Emei all by yourself, you must be no ordinary person.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00207",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "嘁，你要是想要保全性命，就速速回话！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hmph, if you want to keep your life, answer me at once!”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
